Package: BEanalyzer
Type: Package
Title: Average Bioequivalence Analysis and Regulatory Reporting for Crossover Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Navyaa", "M", 
    email = "navyaamuniyappa@gmail.com", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Performs average bioequivalence (ABE) analysis for 2x2 and 3x3 crossover study designs. Automatically fits mixed-effects or linear ANOVA models, computes variance components, least-squares means (LSMeans), 90 percent confidence intervals, TOST, geometric means, descriptive statistics, and residual diagnostics, generating a publication-ready Phoenix WinNonlin style Word report.
